      "title": "Why Apple is finally making its own smart home devices",
      "link": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/1013025/apple-home-collection-products-lg-schneider-smart-home",
      "description": "For more than a decade, Apple has told other companies to build smart home devices for its platform. This week, Apple launched its own. The Apple Home Collection is a lineup of cameras, thermostats, sensors, a smart door lock, and a video doorbell, all codeveloped with LG Electronics and Schneider Electric. They arrive alongside HomeView, [&#8230;]",
