    },
    {
      "title": "Apple&#8217;s HomeView has an app problem",
      "link": "https://www.theverge.com/podcast/1012911/apple-homeview-apps-carplay-vergecast",
      "description": "It's been a couple of days since Apple's big smart home announcement, and we have some more information - and a bunch of new questions - about the Apple HomeView. The device has plenty of computing oomph, is always connected to power, and looks like a perfect place to run a bunch of apps. And [&#8230;]",
